(Acme Industries Limited, Q2 FY27 earnings conference call, 20 October 2026.) Tj T*
(Moderator: Good evening and welcome to the Acme Industries Q2 FY27 earnings call.) Tj T*
(Rahul Mehta, Managing Director: Thank you. Our strategy is to deepen our presence in) Tj T*
(specialty chemicals where we have a cost advantage from our integrated plants.) Tj T*
(Our integrated plants at Dahej give us a cost position that competitors find hard to) Tj T*
(match, and long-term contracts with our top ten customers protect volumes.) Tj T*
(Revenue for the quarter grew 14 percent year on year to 4,820 crore rupees, driven by) Tj T*
(volumes in the specialty segment.) Tj T*
ET
