(Anita Rao, Chief Financial Officer: EBITDA margin improved to 21.5 percent from 19.8) Tj T*
(percent a year ago as raw material prices softened.) Tj T*
(We expect margins to stay in a range of 20 to 22 percent for the rest of the year, subject) Tj T*
(to crude oil prices.) Tj T*
(On capital expenditure, we plan to spend 1,200 crore rupees this year on the new Dahej) Tj T*
(expansion, funded largely from internal accruals.) Tj T*
(Net debt to EBITDA stands at 0.8 times and we repaid 300 crore rupees of borrowings during) Tj T*
(the quarter.) Tj T*
(The board has declared an interim dividend of 6 rupees per share for the year.) Tj T*
ET
